### API Configuration - Test Requests
### Usar con REST Client extension en VSCode o similar

@baseUrl = http://localhost:3001
@contentType = application/json

### Health Check
GET {{baseUrl}}/health

### GET - Obtener configuración global
GET {{baseUrl}}/v1/configuracion/global
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

### POST - Actualizar configuración global (valores válidos)
POST {{baseUrl}}/v1/configuracion/global
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "ivaRateCrew": 0.1525,
  "ivaRateService": 0.19
}

### POST - Actualizar configuración global (otro ejemplo)
POST {{baseUrl}}/v1/configuracion/global
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "ivaRateCrew": 0.15,
  "ivaRateService": 0.20
}

### POST - Error: ivaRateCrew fuera de rango
POST {{baseUrl}}/v1/configuracion/global
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "ivaRateCrew": 1.5,
  "ivaRateService": 0.19
}

### POST - Error: ivaRateService negativo
POST {{baseUrl}}/v1/configuracion/global
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "ivaRateCrew": 0.15,
  "ivaRateService": -0.1
}

### POST - Error: JSON inválido
POST {{baseUrl}}/v1/configuracion/global
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "ivaRateCrew": "invalid"
  "ivaRateService": 0.19
}
